content.text:
Read the invoice in the attached page image(s) and reply with one JSON object that follows this JSON schema exactly:
{
  "$defs": {
    "ExtractedField": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "One field read from the scan, with the model's confidence in it.",
      "properties": {
        "value": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "default": null,
          "title": "Value"
        },
        "confidence": {
          "maximum": 1.0,
          "minimum": 0.0,
          "title": "Confidence",
          "type": "number"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "confidence"
      ],
      "title": "ExtractedField",
      "type": "object"
    }
  },
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "description": "The strict schema the vision model must return.",
  "properties": {
    "vendor_name": {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/ExtractedField"
    },
    "invoice_number": {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/ExtractedField"
    },
    "amount": {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/ExtractedField"
    },
    "currency": {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/ExtractedField"
    },
    "purchase_order": {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/ExtractedField"
    },
    "goods_receipt": {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/ExtractedField"
    }
  },
  "required": [
    "vendor_name",
    "invoice_number",
    "amount",
    "currency",
    "purchase_order",
    "goods_receipt"
  ],
  "title": "InvoiceFields",
  "type": "object"
}
Rules:
- Read only what is visible in the image. Never guess a value.
- For every field give "confidence" between 0 and 1: how certain you are of the value.
- Required fields: vendor_name, invoice_number, amount, currency. Use null for a value you cannot read at all.
- "amount" is digits and a decimal point only, for example "1050.00", with no currency symbol.
- "currency" is the ISO code printed on the invoice, for example "USD".
- purchase_order and goods_receipt are the reference numbers printed on the invoice, or null when the invoice does not cite one.
